{"2430710":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Operator: Observation","steam_appid":2430710,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >**Every design and picture on this page is subject to change as the game is still in early development.** <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are Colin Nox. As part of House Safety Incorporated, you were transferred to one of their facilities deep underground. Your job is simple: watch the monitors, find anomalies, report them, and assign the right taskforces to deal with them. They call you the Observer for a reason.  <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But the anomalies grow stronger with every shift. And your days just keep going by.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Camera System<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three night shifts, and the cameras are your best friend. Switch between rooms and look for anything out of place. Did that chair move? Was that picture always like that? Or maybe something you can only hear? Find it out.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Report and Taskforce System<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spot an anomaly, report it, assign a taskforce. Simple enough. With 5 to 9 anomaly types spread across 5 to 9 rooms, and the layout changing every night, no shift is the same. Hopefully you are ready.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Anomalies<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From light anomalies to shapeshifters, almost everything is waiting for you. Fight for your job and the lives of innocent civilians counting on you.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Beyond the Monitors<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What happens at 8 AM when the shift ends and Colin goes home? At first, home feels like an escape. A place to breathe. But the anomalies do not stay behind the monitors. They follow. They grow. And soon the place Colin calls home becomes just another location to survive.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And then there are the dreams. The Dreamworld is where things stop making sense entirely. A place buried deep in Colin's mind where the anomalies have already made themselves comfortable. Navigating it means confronting something far more personal than a shifting chair or a flickering light.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The facility. The houses. Home. And the mind. Operator: Observation takes you through all of it.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Your Instructor<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From your very first shift, a voice guides you. Your Instructor. Professional, distant, and not exactly known for small talk. Follow the instructions, do your job, and don't ask too many questions. At least that is what they expect from you.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Endings<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this world, the line between good and bad is not always clear. Find your path and reach one of 8 possible endings.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;So. Operator. What are you waiting for? Hop in and help humanity survive one of the most critical situations it has ever faced. And. DON'T. GIVE. UP.&quot;<\/i><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>A message from the CEO of House Safety INC.<\/strong><\/i><\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >**Every design and picture on this page is subject to change as the game is still in early development.** <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are Colin Nox. As part of House Safety Incorporated, you were transferred to one of their facilities deep underground. Your job is simple: watch the monitors, find anomalies, report them, and assign the right taskforces to deal with them. They call you the Observer for a reason.  <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But the anomalies grow stronger with every shift. And your days just keep going by.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Camera System<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three night shifts, and the cameras are your best friend. Switch between rooms and look for anything out of place. Did that chair move? Was that picture always like that? Or maybe something you can only hear? Find it out.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Report and Taskforce System<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spot an anomaly, report it, assign a taskforce. Simple enough. With 5 to 9 anomaly types spread across 5 to 9 rooms, and the layout changing every night, no shift is the same. Hopefully you are ready.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Anomalies<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From light anomalies to shapeshifters, almost everything is waiting for you. Fight for your job and the lives of innocent civilians counting on you.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Beyond the Monitors<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What happens at 8 AM when the shift ends and Colin goes home? At first, home feels like an escape. A place to breathe. But the anomalies do not stay behind the monitors. They follow. They grow. And soon the place Colin calls home becomes just another location to survive.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And then there are the dreams. The Dreamworld is where things stop making sense entirely. A place buried deep in Colin's mind where the anomalies have already made themselves comfortable. Navigating it means confronting something far more personal than a shifting chair or a flickering light.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The facility. The houses. Home. And the mind. Operator: Observation takes you through all of it.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Your Instructor<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From your very first shift, a voice guides you. Your Instructor. Professional, distant, and not exactly known for small talk. Follow the instructions, do your job, and don't ask too many questions. At least that is what they expect from you.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Endings<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this world, the line between good and bad is not always clear. Find your path and reach one of 8 possible endings.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;So. Operator. What are you waiting for? Hop in and help humanity survive one of the most critical situations it has ever faced. And. DON'T. GIVE. UP.&quot;<\/i><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>A message from the CEO of House Safety INC.<\/strong><\/i><\/p>","short_description":"Take on the role of Colin Nox, a security operator monitoring surveillance cameras for anomalies. What starts as a routine job quickly turns sinister as the anomalies grow more aggressive, invading the houses you watch, breaking into your home, and crawling into your mind.","supported_languages":"English<strong>*<\/strong>, German<strong>*<\/strong><br><strong>*<\/strong>languages with full audio support","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2430710\/5149e97828b1564048a00f94feed8ec8f6879e0b\/header.jpg?t=1793728825","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2430710\/a65017180e927d8183a5a93004c6e3e40d655fee\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793728825","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2430710\/a65017180e927d8183a5a93004c6e3e40d655fee\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793728825","website":"https:\/\/stronggamingstudios.com","pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10 &amp; 11<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 9.0<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 15 GB available space<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10 &amp; 11<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 10<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 15 GB available space<\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requirements":[],"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> ---<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> ---<\/li><\/ul>"},"developers":["Stronggaming Studios"],"publishers":["Stronggaming Studios"],"demos":[{"appid":2901190,"description":""}],"price_overview":{"currency":"USD","initial":299,"final":239,"discount_percent":20,"initial_formatted":"$2.99","final_formatted":"$2.39"},"packages":[874697],"package_groups":[{"name":"default","title":"Buy Operator: Observation","description":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","save_text":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","subs":[{"packageid":874697,"percent_savings_text":"-20% ","percent_savings":0,"option_text":"Operator: Observation - <span class=\"discount_original_price\">$2.99<\/span> $2.39","option_description":"","can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"price_in_cents_with_discount":239}]}],"platforms":{"windows":true,"mac":false,"linux":false},"categories":[{"id":2,"description":"Single-player"},{"id":22,"description":"Steam Achievements"},{"id":68,"description":"Custom Volume Controls"},{"id":78,"description":"Adjustable Difficulty"},{"id":69,"description":"Stereo Sound"},{"id":70,"description":"Surround Sound"},{"id":23,"description":"Steam Cloud"},{"id":62,"description":"Family Sharing"}],"genres":[{"id":"23","description":"Indie"},{"id":"70","description":"Early Access"}],"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2430710\/7eeb7f6c2b55ad1f590f34646196af523217e70c\/ss_7eeb7f6c2b55ad1f590f34646196af523217e70c.600x338.jpg?t=1793728825","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2430710\/7eeb7f6c2b55ad1f590f34646196af523217e70c\/ss_7eeb7f6c2b55ad1f590f34646196af5232